      "side": 1,
      "message": "This fixture still spells the broken save command from PS3 (`copy running-configuration startup-configuration`); it only survives because the test is dry-run. The larger gap: no test ever loads the shipped conf/switch_commands.yml - every test builds a private copy of the recipe, so the file this change actually ships (and `initialize()`\u0027s validate-over-Config.vendors loop) is never executed by CI. A single test that loads the shipped file via QUADS_CONF_DIR, validates each vendor under `vendors:` and runs both set operations against fake_switch at 25G and 100G would cover exactly what PS15 changed. I ran that manually: the shipped arista recipe emits `error-correction encoding reed-solomon` + `speed auto 100g-2` + both saves for 100G, and no speed command for speed\u003d0.",
